OL,3,GNEWSARegion's fire crews pay tribute to
OL,4,A9/11 victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews across the region have been
OL,7,Fpaying tribute to victims of the 9/11
OL,8,Fattacks.
OL,10,FIn total 2,977 people were killed,
OL,11,Fincluding 343 firefighters and 67
OL,12,FBritons, after two planes hijacked by
OL,13,FAl Qaeda were flown into the twin
OL,14,Ftowers of the World Trade Centre in New
OL,15,FYork on 11 September, 2001.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
